## Validation Rules

### Contract Requirements
1. All endpoints must be documented
2. Request/response schemas must be defined
3. Authentication requirements must be specified
4. Error responses must be documented

### Sync Protocol
- Sync agent validates API contracts during documentation updates
- Mismatches trigger warnings
- Automated synchronization when possible

